$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Siltar" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n<f1>Max Bases: <f0> 0/0" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Siltar is a dry and barren world with very little moisture.  What little moisture Siltar tends to be evaporated from the parched ground under the intense heat generated by its two suns.  Despite these harsh conditions, small bands of nomdic people still manage to survive amongst the never ending dunes.  Because it is so rare, water is highly valueable, worth much more than life itself.  Both the <$server::teamname0> and <$server::teamname1> bands have discovered a small pool of water situated beneath some ancient desert ruins.  Now both are deadset on acquiring those reserves for themselves, and both are more than prepared to kill any rivals to do so!  In this harsh, unforgiving environment, only the tough survive.\n\nKill the enemy Chieftain while defending your own.  There is nowhere to run, and nowhere to hide except amongst the flowing desert dunes-- protect your Chieftain with your life and after your death with your undying spirit!  The first team to assassinate the enemy Chieftain shall be declared the victor.";